  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Catalyst - Samoa Grid Stability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to assess the best technical and financial solution to stabilize the grid and enable more renewable energy integration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a feasibility study of grid stabilization measures in Samoa, including distributed batteries, system upgrades and capacity training. The aim is to use the feasibility study to develop a concept note requesting funding for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
